            "created_at": "2025-07-21T15:48:26.731651+00:00",
            "notes": "I used to play [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) as my first power. Then I learned that your sleeps will contribute to the count even before you own the power! I think since builds take at least until round 3 to start turning on, we can wait to take [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) on round 3.\n\nSo in that case, taking [Pinpoint Prescription](item_5cfa07d8-7b5d-42df-a9a8-c6a580acb8bc) is what we will do! It will also help us get more cash by allowing us to deal more damage and heal for more. And of course, it is essential to the build. \n\nAs for starting items, take what you like to play most of all. Ana is more vulnerable in the early rounds so adding  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) could be a good idea!",
