            "created_at": "2025-07-21T15:48:26.731651+00:00",
            "notes": "Buy [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4). Sell everything if you have to. I like to think that this item is one of the best in the game. Nearly guaranteeing sleeps will allow coordinated teams to guarantee an elim. And with [Pinpoint Prescription](item_5cfa07d8-7b5d-42df-a9a8-c6a580acb8bc) already purchased, it will allow you to deal with diving dps or support all on your own. \n\nTry to find a balance of sleeping off cooldown and holding for when the time is right. (typically around the time the enemy team would have ults).",
