        {
            "id": "74a72dd6-a0e5-4196-99d2-38e9334f3f37",
            "build_id": "b77caefd-e829-4a7c-aa39-a3c6afba414e",
            "round_number": 4,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-21T15:48:26.731651+00:00",
            "notes": "I am going to suggest [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) this round since it is still important to heal. However, if you have a good Mercy or a Moira/Lucio that is more focused on healing, you can opt for something else.\n\n[Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) if need more pressure on flying heroes.\n\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) is good for cooldown reduction and the added damage. Each use of  [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) will trigger this item!\n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) if you have the money, this will get you the highest dps. but I wouldn't sell other items for it yet.\n\n-----\n\nAt this point, eliminating diving heroes has become easy! Sleep the diving hero with your enhanced Sleep Dart and make sure you take your time to line up the headshot. The combo I typically do is Sleep-Headshot-Nade-Bodyshot-Melee",
