            "created_at": "2025-07-21T15:48:26.731651+00:00",
            "notes": "This round, The powers you take are up to you. The build is online and all that is left are a few upgrades to it. \n[Our Turn](item_6e0fdb41-c00f-41d9-8ec2-1246b34a539a) combined with [Eye of Horus](item_169551ce-e4e5-4a14-9ec4-abdc25673939) will give your team a big edge in the fight. Hitting each teammate around you regardless of walls. \n\n[Your Full Potential](item_f03b3a26-0d1b-46bc-85e6-92f060b53b4e) is also an option too if you have a WP Soldier/Genji. Orisa also gets her Ult fast and can work well with her to swing a team fight.\n\nFor items, take what you can afford! Just DO NOT take [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27). Ana's gun does not benefit from Codebreakers armor reduction as she already gets a 100% reduction because her primary damage is damage over time (DOT).",
